Error [jet.ReservedPackedLayout]: `align` requires one integer byte value or `$build.cpu.cache_line` (or `align(target, N)`)
  --> tests/ui/layout_align_not_bytes_grouped.jet:1:19
    |
  1 | #[Layout(c, align(line)), Codable]
    |                   ^^^^
 Why: `#Layout(c, align(N))` is compiler-owned ABI metadata
 Fix: Write `align(64)`, `align($build.cpu.cache_line)` or `align(target, 2097152)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1105
